WEBVTT

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.700
Cayna seems to be having fun!

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:12.920
She sure does.

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:18.070
What's up?

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:23.440
You want us to hurry back home?

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:27.880
Let's go.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:30.500
What's wrong, Cayna?

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:34.200
Something bad might be going on at the capital.

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:36.610
Summon Magic!

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:44.110
Therwolf!

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:49.910
Hop on!

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:07.060
What is that thing?

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:56.030
[Battle, Victory, Discussion, and Information]

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:57.870
Run away! Run!

00:03:00.890 --> 00:03:03.610
You, lead the civilians' evacuation.

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:06.160
What will you do?

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:07.410
You don't have to ask.

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:13.200
I'm gonna kill it!

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:14.990
But that's an event monster!

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:20.810
We'd likely need at least 200 players
at around level 300 to kill it.

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:22.410
But if you know that…

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:23.910
I'm the knight-captain!

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:27.090
I have to believe I can defend this country!

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:30.500
If now's not the time to fight, when is?!

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:31.910
Dude…

00:03:37.930 --> 00:03:39.480
Skargo, Kartatz!

00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:41.550
Mai-Mai and Lopus?

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:42.910
Glad you're alright.

00:03:43.210 --> 00:03:44.490
What of the students?

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:46.490
They've all been evacuated.

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:48.070
How are the people?

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:51.190
The knights have been ordered into action.

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:53.390
They're providing aid.

00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:57.100
Sorry. I never expected
such a beast would show up…

00:03:57.940 --> 00:03:59.910
That behemoth is your doing, Lopus?!

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:01.120
Not on purpose!

00:04:01.430 --> 00:04:03.480
Hang on! Explanations can wait.

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:05.490
That thing certainly won't!

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:06.810
This is bad.

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:09.400
That beast is clearly beyond our ability.

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:11.810
If you can think, you can act.

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:14.030
We can still slow it down, Kartatz!

00:04:15.490 --> 00:04:16.710
Wait, sister mine.

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:20.390
If we draw its attention here,

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:24.010
it will close in on what lies behind us.

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:26.430
The castle!

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:29.340
Th-Then what should we do?!

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:33.310
Wring our hands and watch
as it destroys the city?!

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:42.010
Cohral?

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:43.810
I'll go with ya.

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:46.170
I'm not against suicide missions.

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:48.010
Sorry. I owe you.

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:50.910
Drinks are on me when this is over.

00:04:51.360 --> 00:04:52.550
Sounds good to me.

00:04:52.910 --> 00:04:55.310
Booze tastes better when someone else pays.

00:04:57.920 --> 00:04:58.560
Let's go!

00:04:58.660 --> 00:04:59.270
Got it!

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:02.610
The enemy is huge!

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:05.400
Smash into its head and knock it down!

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:06.820
I know the strat!

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:09.360
Weapon Skill: Double Crush!

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:12.790
Weapon Skill: Pike Ring Attack!

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:26.010
Who just…?

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:28.200
One was the knight-captain.

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:31.280
I don't know who the other was.

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:36.020
Dammit…

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:38.410
Who could've seen that coming?

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:39.810
Hey, Cohral!

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:41.270
You alive?

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:45.800
Yeah, I'm alive.

00:05:46.690 --> 00:05:47.860
Hang in there.

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:51.780
You really are over level 400.

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:54.900
I'm under 20% HP left.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.530
If it's too much, rest up.

00:05:56.780 --> 00:05:57.820
I'll handle it.

00:05:58.370 --> 00:05:59.560
Nice joke.

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:06.610
We hit it that hard,

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:10.790
but it's only lost a sliver of its HP.

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:14.320
And here I was putting my all into that.

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:18.210
Guess all we can do is go at it again.

00:06:18.860 --> 00:06:19.710
Yeah…

00:06:20.300 --> 00:06:22.500
Maybe we can take it down with us when…

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:40.470
Thank goodness.

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:42.500
And that's that. We're saved.

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:46.410
W-What's going on?

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:49.690
That threat is no longer threatening.

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:51.810
That's all.

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:14.510
Both the strongest lightning magic,

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:16.440
and the strongest fire magic?

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:17.500
Yeah.

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:19.800
That had to be a player's work.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:22.200
There are players other than us?

00:07:29.610 --> 00:07:30.480
Jeez…

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:33.890
Who the heck activated that event monster?

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:39.590
Oh, I see.

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:41.170
So that's what it was.

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:51.990
There was an event monster set up
on this sandbar, of all places?

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:59.180
Activation items are a liquid made from
mixed oksorre root, logga eyes, and nweve tongue.

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:02.700
So he mixed up a bunch of rare materials
and got unlucky.

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:06.700
Meaning this was just a big pile of coincidences.

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:10.430
Looks like she can see it, too, huh.

00:08:10.730 --> 00:08:14.610
Yeah. So she's that mommy's boy
of a high priest's mother?

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:16.210
Mai-Mai.

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:18.890
Yes?! What do you desire, Mother?

00:08:19.280 --> 00:08:22.990
Don't let anyone come near here.
Make this place off-limits.

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:25.910
If this ever happens again…

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:28.620
Yes? What would you do if it does?

00:08:29.180 --> 00:08:31.470
I can't let it be used for evil,

00:08:31.590 --> 00:08:35.310
so I'd blow this whole sandbar to bits
and sink it into the river.

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:38.310
Okay! I'll put up a barrier and quarantine it,

00:08:38.670 --> 00:08:42.030
and throw anyone who comes near
right into jail, one by one!

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:47.300
We should take our leave, Princess.

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:49.510
Your father has been worried sick.

00:08:49.780 --> 00:08:52.410
I'm sorry. I acted rashly.

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:54.400
I-I'm sorry, too.

00:08:54.710 --> 00:08:59.880
If you want guard services again,
bring a reward and request it through the guild.

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:02.920
You plan to charge me?!

00:09:03.210 --> 00:09:05.780
I did it this time because it was Lonti asking,

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:09.300
but I won't be party to another royal kidnapping.

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:11.120
How shrewd of you.

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:12.720
I'd expect no less!

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:15.700
You'd be better off paying Agaido!

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:19.330
Thank you for your service!

00:09:26.300 --> 00:09:27.250
O, Mother.

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:33.280
Here.

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:39.130
This…

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:41.010
This is orichalcum!

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:42.560
Why give it to me?

00:09:43.090 --> 00:09:45.410
That creature dropped it.

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:49.800
The two who fought it say they have no need of it,

00:09:50.470 --> 00:09:51.900
and so it is yours.

00:09:52.280 --> 00:09:54.810
We don't have the skills to process the stuff,

00:09:55.170 --> 00:09:58.910
and you beat the thing,
so it's best if you keep it, yeah?

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:02.390
Really? Then how about I make you something?

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:03.850
Huh? For me?!

00:10:04.280 --> 00:10:06.400
I've got all the weapons I need.

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:09.680
Consider it a thanks for your efforts.

00:10:11.930 --> 00:10:14.510
How about a sword? I see you don't have one.

00:10:15.890 --> 00:10:17.280
That works. Thanks.

00:10:17.870 --> 00:10:20.800
Also, the captain and I
need to have a talk with you.

00:10:22.610 --> 00:10:24.820
Can you make time for it tomorrow?

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:26.200
Sure.

00:10:26.530 --> 00:10:28.590
How's noon at the colosseum?

00:10:28.800 --> 00:10:29.320
Okay.

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:31.110
Alright. I'm gonna head off.

00:10:34.810 --> 00:10:38.970
Kartatz, could you take me
to the Velveteen Rabbit?

00:10:39.510 --> 00:10:40.720
And where is that?

00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:44.010
Cayna, it was Black Rabbit's Cottontail.

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:45.690
Was it?

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:47.770
Why are you going to Cottontail?

00:10:48.030 --> 00:10:50.530
I took a fetch quest for some horned bear.

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:53.600
I got the bear, so I gotta deliver it.

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:56.780
So why did you have the princess with you?

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:59.780
Well, uh… It just happened?

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:01.590
Really? "It just happened"?

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:06.010
Cohral, show me what you got!

00:11:06.050 --> 00:11:08.510
You got it! I bet you were lonely!

00:11:15.220 --> 00:11:17.400
Allow us to reintroduce ourselves.

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:19.680
I'm Shining Saber.

00:11:20.390 --> 00:11:22.200
I'm level 427.

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:25.890
Currently, I'm Felskeilo's knight-captain,

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:29.810
but I used to be the Silver-Moon
Horsemen guild's sub-leader.

00:11:30.630 --> 00:11:32.300
Wait, the Silver-Moon Horsemen?

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:34.420
With Kyotaro?

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:38.800
You knew our guild master?!

00:11:39.470 --> 00:11:41.800
Yeah, I guess you could say that.

00:11:42.490 --> 00:11:44.400
I was in the same guild.

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:47.760
I'm Cohral, level 392.

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:51.190
I'm Cayna. My guild was Cream Cheese.

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:56.230
I see they know about us.

00:11:56.490 --> 00:12:02.160
Cream Cheese?! Isn't that the guild
made of Limit Breakers with GM privileges?!

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:08.380
Wait, wait! You know my guild master,
you're a high elf, and you're from Cream Cheese?!

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:10.310
Don't tell me… You're…

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:12.690
The Silver-Ring Witch?!

00:12:13.110 --> 00:12:14.680
Got it in one!

00:12:19.490 --> 00:12:21.070
The Arcana Staff?!

00:12:21.150 --> 00:12:22.900
What are you gonna do with that?

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:27.110
I'm not a fan of that degrading
Silver-Ring Whatever nickname.

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:28.920
If you say it again…

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:33.510
You're going over the horizon, without warning.

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:37.120
Okay! I get it, so please stop
making that horrifying face!

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:39.400
Alright, fine.

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:44.240
Oh, right. Cohral!

00:12:45.460 --> 00:12:48.090
About what I promised you yesterday…

00:12:49.550 --> 00:12:50.750
Here you go.

00:12:52.270 --> 00:12:53.400
Looks nice.

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:55.600
So, what're the stats…?

00:12:56.260 --> 00:12:58.080
What the hell?!

00:12:58.180 --> 00:13:00.590
What, what? What did you get?!

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:03.790
Valhalla?!

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:06.380
Isn't that the strongest weapon out there?!

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:12.210
I had some diamond and corundum
on hand, so I put my all into it!

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:15.800
This goes past just "putting your all into it"!

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:19.310
Damn, I want one, too!

00:13:19.580 --> 00:13:21.990
C'mon, don't you have another?

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:24.070
But you already have a nice weapon.

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:26.340
This thing's standard-issue for knights.

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:28.710
I don't have the mats, either way.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:33.310
W-Well, guess I'll give up on that.

00:13:34.070 --> 00:13:36.250
I wanna trade info, anyway.

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:39.730
I've only been in this world
for three years, after all.

00:13:39.970 --> 00:13:40.960
Ten for me.

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:43.790
Just about two months for me.

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:47.810
So… why'd Leadale's service end?

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:49.100
Why do you ask?

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:54.410
I mean, I died IRL while logged in,
so I'm kinda short on info.

00:13:55.700 --> 00:13:57.080
Oh, is that all?

00:13:58.000 --> 00:13:59.530
Wait, you're a ghost?!

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:02.210
Who are you calling a ghost? How rude.

00:14:02.310 --> 00:14:04.410
Oh, so that's it.

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:08.800
I remember hearing rumors about someone
dying while playing. That was you?

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:11.800
Ew, really? There were rumors about me?

00:14:11.920 --> 00:14:12.710
Yeah…

00:14:13.070 --> 00:14:18.090
About half a year after that rumor spread,
Leadale's service ended.

00:14:18.690 --> 00:14:21.690
I don't know if it was
because of your death, though.

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:23.330
I see.

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:28.580
Guess if I wanna know more,
I gotta get Li'l Fairy able to talk and ask her.

00:14:28.780 --> 00:14:30.800
Li'l… Fairy?

00:14:33.900 --> 00:14:35.110
What the heck?!

00:14:36.550 --> 00:14:40.100
So players can see her, huh?

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:42.000
Come on out, little one.

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:45.010
Li'l Fairy… Li'l Fairy…

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:46.000
Dude, creepy.

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:52.210
Opuskettenshultheimer, another player,
left Li'l Fairy behind for me.

00:14:52.510 --> 00:14:54.620
I'm sure he had a reason to do it.

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:56.240
Upuskett…?

00:14:56.560 --> 00:14:57.850
Never heard of him.

00:14:58.390 --> 00:15:01.010
He's also known as Leadale's Kongming.

00:15:01.350 --> 00:15:03.110
Ugh, him?!

00:15:03.220 --> 00:15:03.990
You know him?

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:10.990
I dodged a log rolling down a mountain, but got
my leg caught on a rope and pulled with it,

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:14.590
then I died when he kicked me into the valley.

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:21.890
You, too?!

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:24.410
We have the same emotional scars!

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:27.110
Is this supposed to be a comedy?

00:15:29.130 --> 00:15:31.140
Okay, enough with the farce.

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:34.150
Let's hurry up and add each other as friends.

00:15:34.860 --> 00:15:36.110
O-Okay.

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:38.110
[Accept friend request from Cohral?]

00:15:38.110 --> 00:15:40.950
[Accept friend request from Cohral?]
Now we can keep in touch wherever we go.

00:15:41.220 --> 00:15:45.370
Oh, right. If you know anything
about Guardian Towers, could you tell me?

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:46.990
Lemme think…

00:15:48.410 --> 00:15:53.790
Got it! Hey, Cayna, wanna trade info on skills
for info on Guardian Towers?

00:15:53.900 --> 00:15:55.710
Skills? Like what?

00:15:57.800 --> 00:15:59.110
Healing magic…

00:15:59.210 --> 00:16:00.610
- You don't have any?!
- You ain't got it yet?!

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:03.920
The event to get it was so simple, though!

00:16:04.210 --> 00:16:07.000
I've never met a player without it.

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:08.320
Oh, shut it!

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:13.370
Okay, fine, as long as your info's good.

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:14.730
Awright!

00:16:14.980 --> 00:16:16.390
What are you, seven?

00:16:16.630 --> 00:16:18.710
So you have some leads, then?

00:16:21.510 --> 00:16:25.420
The people at this fishing village say
they saw a palace in the ocean.

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:28.660
That oughta be worth some magic, right?!

00:16:29.690 --> 00:16:32.900
Underwater, huh? Probably Liothek's, then.

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:33.910
C'mon!

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:35.270
Sure.

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:37.520
I'll give you healing magic.

00:16:37.900 --> 00:16:40.330
Here. Simple healing magic. "Dyul."

00:16:41.530 --> 00:16:42.430
Install!

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:45.860
Dun-da-dun!

00:16:45.920 --> 00:16:48.010
Healing magic, get!

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:49.110
Thanks!

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:52.100
Your face darkened at the "underwater" part.

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:53.800
Can you not swim?

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:56.620
Yeah, that's right.

00:16:56.890 --> 00:17:01.210
But I can use magic
to handle that part. It's just…

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:07.830
Skill Master Liothek liked to collect
gross or ugly-cute things.

00:17:09.300 --> 00:17:12.300
Thinking of all the nasty things waiting for me…

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:13.610
It's depressing.

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:15.320
Oh!

00:17:15.580 --> 00:17:17.530
I need to get back to the castle.

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:20.310
Cayna, contact me if you need anything.

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:22.360
'Kay, I'm off, too.

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:23.710
Thanks again.

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:26.510
See you at the guild!

00:17:26.710 --> 00:17:28.420
Yup! See you later.

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:31.820
Hey. Wanna trade Valhalla for my sword?

00:17:32.020 --> 00:17:33.500
Nobody would do that.

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:36.300
I can feel the camaraderie.

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:38.210
I'm kinda jealous!

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:41.800
Aww, you're trying to cheer me up?

00:17:42.260 --> 00:17:43.110
Thanks!

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:44.580
Behind you. Ska…

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:50.420
Huh?!

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:53.410
Skargo?!

00:17:53.650 --> 00:17:55.200
Oh, jeez…

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:57.310
Y-You okay?

00:17:57.400 --> 00:17:59.330
He was not fast enough.

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:02.300
O, Mother, are you unharmed?!

00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:07.000
Upon hearing My Mother was meeting men in secret,

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:10.990
I, Skargo, dropped everything to come save you!

00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:12.890
Earth to Skargo.

00:18:13.510 --> 00:18:16.780
What manner of threat
did those men have you under?!

00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:19.210
And worst of all, yes, worst!

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:22.420
One was the knight-captain, of all people?!

00:18:22.880 --> 00:18:26.580
I cannot allow men like that
to do as they please with My Mother!

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:28.920
Curse you, Shining Saber!

00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:33.900
You thought you could ply
misogynistic wiles upon Our Mother?

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:36.620
Have you renounced your code of chival…

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:38.090
O, Mother?

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:39.510
Yes, Skargo?

00:18:41.860 --> 00:18:45.970
W-What might you be doing
with your Arcana Staff raised like that?

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:48.810
What goes up must come down, don't you know?

00:18:48.900 --> 00:18:52.190
I feel like I'm in the spot
you intend it to land, though…

00:18:52.570 --> 00:18:54.010
What a coincidence!

00:18:54.490 --> 00:18:57.800
Maybe it'd be a good idea
to stop talking, then, hmm?

00:18:58.130 --> 00:19:00.140
I beg your forgiveness!

00:19:00.690 --> 00:19:02.290
As long as you understand.

00:19:02.770 --> 00:19:04.190
You won't hit me?

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:07.090
O, Mother, did something happen?

00:19:07.420 --> 00:19:08.320
Nope.

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:10.320
Nothing special.

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:15.590
Well, I'm gonna get going.
Make sure to do your job, okay?

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:16.630
C-Certainly.

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:18.010
O, Mother!

00:19:19.190 --> 00:19:21.010
I obtained some good teas.

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:23.680
Would you join me for tea?

00:19:25.490 --> 00:19:28.260
Sure thing. I could stand to have a cup.

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:39.200
If he's like this with me, I can't imagine
he even noticed the princess's advances.

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:41.700
Mye's got a tough road ahead.

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:49.130
You're going on another journey?

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:51.810
Yup, to find the Dragon King's palace.

00:19:52.530 --> 00:19:58.620
Have you heard about how Felskeilo and Helshper's
knights are teaming up to mop up bandits?

00:19:58.820 --> 00:19:59.470
Yes?

00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:02.720
Well, they're leaving in two days,

00:20:02.850 --> 00:20:06.610
and the knight-captain asked me
to accompany them partway.

00:20:08.280 --> 00:20:12.460
Mother… Don't you think it's about time
for you to settle down somewhere?

00:20:12.650 --> 00:20:13.620
Settle down?

00:20:13.710 --> 00:20:16.090
Everyone puts down roots eventually.

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:19.690
Settling down… Settling down, huh?

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:21.610
That does sound nice.

00:20:22.440 --> 00:20:25.700
If I'm gonna live somewhere,
it'd have to be that village.

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:34.590
Well, look who it is! It's been forever, you know!

00:20:35.860 --> 00:20:39.880
For reals, my master sure does love abandoning me.

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:43.860
Hearing you talk like that
makes me think you don't want any MP.

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:48.610
'Course I want some!
Yer a right sadist, ain'tcha, Mastah.

00:20:49.020 --> 00:20:51.100
Where'd the accent come from?

00:20:53.570 --> 00:20:54.190
Alright.

00:20:55.350 --> 00:20:56.980
I'll give you your MP.

00:20:57.510 --> 00:20:59.910
That's the stuff, young'un!

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:03.810
Quit talking like an old man getting into a bath.

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:08.710
Oh, right! Do you recall anything
happening in this world 200 years ago?

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:12.720
I only know what I heard from other Guardians,

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:18.810
and most of them were just
given good-byes from their masters.

00:21:19.890 --> 00:21:22.420
Really? Well, makes sense.

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:24.260
Guess that's that, then.

00:21:24.500 --> 00:21:26.010
Hey, Master.

00:21:26.290 --> 00:21:28.700
I'm not big on abandonment.

00:21:29.000 --> 00:21:32.900
Don't worry. I'll be starting to
come back regularly.

00:21:33.490 --> 00:21:34.250
Probably!

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:43.200
There… And there…

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:48.500
And that does it.

00:21:57.390 --> 00:21:58.640
Miss!

00:22:05.880 --> 00:22:08.300
How've you been, Lytt?

00:22:08.590 --> 00:22:09.240
Good!
